# Project structure

- Domain UI → `src/components/[domain]/`
- Shared UI (≥2 domains) → `src/components/shared/`
- API clients → `src/services/[api-name]/{client,schemas,utils}`
- Global utils/types/constants → `src/utils`, `src/types`, `src/constants`
- E2E → `e2e/[domain]/[path].spec.ts`
- Next.js routes → `src/app/`; Vite screens → `src/pages/`

Do not call Tanstack Query/fetch directly from components — go through `services/`.
Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`
